					"content": "所以，我也这样相信着你，一直在默默为你祈祷。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732200861
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芭别尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 732200861,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732200862
					],
					"speakerTitle": "婕德"
				},
				{
					"id": 732200862,
					"content": "…抱歉，芭别尔主母，是我顶撞您了。",
